#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-thunder-H7.rst:33
#: be499da730b343ce9d9c7b6273fa64f9
msgid ""
"6x UARTs/serial for GPS and other peripherals. All UARTS support hardware "
"inversion. SBUS, SmartPort, and other inverted protocols work on any UART "
"without “uninvert hack”"
msgstr ""
"6x UART/串口用于 GPS 和其他外设。所有 UART 支持硬件反转。SBUS、SmartPort 和其他反转协议可在任意 UART "
"上工作，无需「uninvert hack」"

