#: 6c5d3294653a46b8b50f4806087dc078
msgid "SERIAL4 -> UART4 (GPS, DMA-enabled)"
msgstr "SERIAL4 -> UART4（GPS，支持 DMA）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-thunder-H7.rst:67
#: b1fe10a8403d47bdae17eec4167f9333
msgid "SERIAL6 -> UART6 (ESC Telemetry)"
msgstr "SERIAL6 -> UART6（ESC 数传）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-thunder-H7.rst:70
#: da4d5d486d8940d193dbc6e0521d4d65
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-thunder-H7.rst:72
#: 8fcd677b82824ed1a7fc3a16e956ed40
msgid ""
"RC input is configured on the R2 (UART2_RX) pin. It supports all serial RC "
"protocols. Use T2 also for duplex protocols such as CRSF. For protocols "
"requiring half-duplex serial to transmit telemetry (such as FPort) you "
"should setup SERIAL2 with half-duplex and attach input to T2."
msgstr ""
"RC 输入配置在 R2（UART2_RX）引脚。支持所有串口 RC 协议。对于 CRSF 等双工协议，也使用 T2。对于需要半双工串口发送数传的协议（如"
" FPort），应将 SERIAL2 配置为半双工，并将输入连接到 T2。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-thunder-H7.rst:77
#: 63ffc4c01e4b47c2a59808db4c31fc4b
msgid "FrSky Telemetry"
msgstr "FrSky 数传"

#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-thunder-H7.rst:79
#: 8ca8fdfdbaf14e66a38cfe2c9a5e99cc
msgid ""
"FrSky Telemetry could supported using the T3 pin (UART3 transmit) (or any "
"other free UART). You need to set the following parameters to enable support"
" for FrSky S.PORT"
msgstr ""
"FrSky 数传可使用 T3 引脚（UART3 发送）（或任何其他空闲 UART）支持。需要设置以下参数以启用 FrSky S.PORT 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-thunder-H7.rst:82
#: 518cad9de62a4087b8faf160d5f8a10e
msgid "SERIAL3_PROTOCOL 10"
msgstr "SERIAL3_PROTOCOL 10"

#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-thunder-H7.rst:83
#: 6488088f6ad6438bb74b25f6d70ea863
msgid "SERIAL3_OPTIONS 7"
msgstr "SERIAL3_OPTIONS 7"

#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-thunder-H7.rst:86
#: a9a4665b766249eeb60134722dc4c1fd
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-thunder-H7.rst:88
#: 0bff8c8c86684bd988a9d441b0694752
msgid ""
"The iFlight Thunder H7 supports MSP DisplayPort OSDs using OSD_TYPE 5 and "
"SERIAL1 by default (on HD VTX connector)"
msgstr ""
"iFlight Thunder H7 默认使用 OSD_TYPE 5 和 SERIAL1 支持 MSP DisplayPort OSD（在 HD VTX"
" 连接器上）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-thunder-H7.rst:91
#: e1035c16dc2e418aa743163f22fd3756
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-thunder-H7.rst:93
#: 01317c5971394638b23ac6e9a7baf9ca
msgid ""
"The iFlight Thunder H7 supports up to 9 PWM outputs. The pads for motor "
"output M1 to M8 are provided in the motor connector, plus M9 on a separate "
"pad for LED strip or another PWM output."
msgstr ""
"iFlight Thunder H7 支持最多 9 路 PWM 输出。电机输出 M1 至 M8 的焊盘在电机连接器上提供，另有 M9 在单独焊盘上，用于"
" LED 灯条或其他 PWM 输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-thunder-H7.rst:97
#: 8b634cea4d84445b9c815683804d4905
msgid "The PWM is in 5 groups:"
msgstr "PWM 分为 5 组："

#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-thunder-H7.rst:100
#: b49aba2734b44837a18a841f009a8510
msgid "PWM 1-2   in group1"
msgstr "PWM 1-2 在第 1 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-thunder-H7.rst:101
#: 4da2a155c15343ee875fa4bdef6c486f
msgid "PWM 3-6   in group2"
msgstr "PWM 3-6 在第 2 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-thunder-H7.rst:102
#: b03efd80964842e1b3af86aa59c2bc8c
msgid "PWM 7-8   in group3"
msgstr "PWM 7-8 在第 3 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-thunder-H7.rst:103
#: fe91a83e8f424311b59bcafcb4378ef8
msgid "PWM 9     in group4"
msgstr "PWM 9 在第 4 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-thunder-H7.rst:105
#: d8ceaa5390ab4a2da7d21404de70aa11
msgid ""
"Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate. If any "
"channel in a group uses DShot then all channels in the group need to use "
"DShot. Channels 1-8 support bi-directional dshot."
msgstr ""
"同一组内的通道需使用相同的输出频率。如果某组内有通道使用 DShot，则该组所有通道都需使用 DShot。通道 1-8 支持双向 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-thunder-H7.rst:110
#: 8ab023057a604cd6ac669fed0ea8f6dd
msgid "Battery Monitoring"
msgstr "电池监测"

#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-thunder-H7.rst:112
#: ca1b2cdc40f14089b0fff91995f2c469
msgid ""
"The board has a built-in voltage senso and a current sensor input. The "
"voltage sensor can handle up to 6S LiPo batteries."
msgstr "本板内置电压传感器和电流传感器输入。电压传感器最高支持 6S LiPo 电池。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-thunder-H7.rst:115
#: c2a2e10d9151433eae53b334ea6daf12
msgid "The correct battery setting parameters are:"
msgstr "正确的电池设置参数为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-thunder-H7.rst:118
#: ed425f68a68c4ab09ebb31599558c644
msgid ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` = 4"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` = 4"

#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-thunder-H7.rst:119
#: 1d1b0d63b4d9483c8884fbc7b779b93e
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11"

#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-thunder-H7.rst:120
#: 5042fc36f9a6469591b8283e28f45d65
msgid ":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 13"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 13"

#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-thunder-H7.rst:121
#: 6a642f7d5d694c3aaf5d340b39c22100
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11.1"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11.1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-thunder-H7.rst:122
#: 39d5badcd5544bcf930a90af68783d1c
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 64 (needs "
"to be adjusted for whatever current sensor is being used)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = "
"64（需根据所用电流传感器进行调整）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-thunder-H7.rst:125
#: 06f68b9ead8f4c858d972da3b843317e
msgid "Compass"
msgstr "罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-thunder-H7.rst:127
#: c097dfc7e6d74853b383ea729191d62f
msgid ""
"The iFlight Thunder H7 does not have a built-in compass, but you can attach "
"an external compass using I2C on the SDA and SCL pads."
msgstr "iFlight Thunder H7 没有内置罗盘，但可通过 SDA 和 SCL 焊盘上的 I2C 连接外部罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-thunder-H7.rst:130
#: fed49f1e1493421a85c59e765c6545cd
msgid "VTX power control"
msgstr "VTX 电源控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-thunder-H7.rst:132
#: 2dc3b307c23c401f85da46814e669709
msgid ""
"GPIO 81 controls the VTX BEC output to pins marked \"10V\". Setting this "
"GPIO low removes voltage supply to pins. By default RELAY2 is configured to "
"control this pin and sets the GPIO high."
msgstr ""
"GPIO 81 控制标有「10V」引脚的 VTX BEC 输出。将此 GPIO 拉低将断开该引脚的供电。默认情况下，RELAY2 配置为控制此引脚并将 "
"GPIO 拉高。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-thunder-H7.rst:136
#: 3fbbc3cb960c4bc3b151e0fa1ae93e4f
msgid "Firmware"
msgstr "固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-thunder-H7.rst:138
#: 7dd91f183a994520ad5249fd571b41d2
msgid ""
"Firmware for this board can be found `here "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ in  sub-folders labeled "
"\"IFLIGHT_2RAW_H7\"."
msgstr ""
"本板固件可在 `此处 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ "
"找到，位于标记为「IFLIGHT_2RAW_H7」的子文件夹中。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-thunder-H7.rst:141
#: f088fe2b84614f6d9995bfb70a97fe2b
msgid "Loading Firmware"
msgstr "加载固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-thunder-H7.rst:143
#: 53da7fa60aa144e3b4b918ed2c2ddee0
msgid ""
"Initial firmware load can be done with DFU by plugging in USB with the "
"bootloader button pressed. Then you should load the \"with_bl.hex\" "
"firmware, using your favourite DFU loading tool."
msgstr ""
"首次固件加载可通过 DFU 完成，即按住 boot 按钮同时插入 USB。然后使用您喜欢的 DFU 工具加载「with_bl.hex」固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-iflight-thunder-H7.rst:147
#: a1c0da93ec2349048ce6d31ca63e2ef1
msgid ""
"Once the initial firmware is loaded you can update the firmware using any "
"ArduPilot ground station software. Updates should be done with the \\*.apj "
"firmware files."
msgstr "初始固件加载完成后，可使用任何 ArduPilot 地面站软件更新固件。更新应使用 \\*.apj 固件文件。"
